    "title": "骑拉帝纳（XY-P）",
    "pageid": 163875,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>騎拉帝納</b>（日文︰<b><span lang=\"ja\">ギラティナ</span></b>，英文︰<b>Giratina</b>）是一張<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\">超</a>屬性的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"基礎寶可夢（TCG）\">基礎寶可夢</a>卡。\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">目次</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#卡牌信息\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">卡牌資訊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#收录卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">收錄卡包</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#日文和英文卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><span><b>日文和英文卡包</b></span></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#获得方法\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">獲得方法</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#284/XY-P\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">284/XY-P</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#XY184\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">XY184</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#细节\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">細節</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8D.A1.E7.89.8C.E4.BF.A1.E6.81.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"卡牌信息\">卡牌資訊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：卡牌資訊\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 卡牌資訊\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"bg-超C bd-超C roundy-15 at-c a-c\" style=\"border-width:3px;max-width:500px;width:100%;&#124;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-超C bgl-钢 textblack at-c\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.2em;color:initial;width:20%;white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"基礎寶可夢（TCG）\">基礎</a></b><br />\n</td>\n<th class=\"roundybr-25 bg-魂银 bd-超C\" style=\"padding-top:6px; line-height:30px;\"><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3\" title=\"騎拉帝納\">騎拉帝納</a></span></div> <div style=\"float:right;\">&#160;&#160;</div>\n</th>\n<td class=\"at-r va-c\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"\"><span class=\"va-c\"><b><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">HP</span><span style=\"font-size:27px;\">130</span></b></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/45px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/60px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td class=\"roundyleft-6 roundyright-20 at-l\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;height:1em;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); display:none;\">從[[:Category:（TCG）|]]進化\n</td>\n<td style=\";\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"textwhite a-r at-c roundybr-30\" style=\"color:initial;font-size:0.9em;width:100%;background: -webkit-linear-gradient(left,#e7c4da 3%, #b1e1f5 50%, #cce7c8 100%); display:none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/b/b1/%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97_%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%BC%81%E5%88%92.svg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10px;text-shadow:2px 2px 10px #2e5b92;\"><i><b>騎拉帝納<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96ex%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超級進化ex（TCG）\">超級進化</a>後的樣子</b></i></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;height:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" class=\"at-l\">\n<table width=\"40%\" class=\"a-r at-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: -webkit-linear-gradient(left,#110404 2%,#E02929 38%,#110404 60%);\" class=\"bd-OR bw-2 roundytl-60 textwhite\"><big><i><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A9%B6%E6%9E%81%E5%BC%82%E5%85%BD%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"究極異獸（TCG）\">究極異獸</a></i></big>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c bg- roundybr-30 roundyleft\" style=\"width:90%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"textwhite\" style=\"width:22%;\"><big><span class=\"lang-zh-\"></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"></span></big>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundybr-30 roundytl textwhite\" style=\"font-size:0.9em;height:1em;background:#000;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\"></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><small></small></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small></small></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-超C textwhite\" style=\"background:#FFF; height:170px; border-width:3px; width:430px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:XYP284.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/b/b0/XYP284.jpg/170px-XYP284.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"237\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/b/b0/XYP284.jpg/255px-XYP284.jpg 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/b/b0/XYP284.jpg/340px-XYP284.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"\"><small>全國圖鑑No.487&#160;&#160;反抗寶可夢&#160;&#160;身高:4.5m&#160;&#160;體重:750.0kg&#160;&#160;</small>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<table width=\"95%\" class=\"bg-心金 roundy-5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"a-c at-l bd-黑 roundy-5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"textwhite bgd-超C roundy-5\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">將自己手牌中2張騎拉帝納LEGEND加以組合，放置於備戰區。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">手札にある2枚の{{{jname}}}LEGENDを組み合わせて、ベンチに出す。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Put this card from your hand onto your Bench only with the other half of {{{ename}}} LEGEND.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><table class=\"a-c\" style=\"width:95%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" width=\"100px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"特性\"><img alt=\"特性\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/0/06/TCGAbilityIcon.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"87\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.7em;\"><span class=\"t-红宝石\"><b><span class=\"lang-zh-\">噬光</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">噬光</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">ひかりをのみこむ</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Devour Light</span></b></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-r\" style=\"font-size:1.6em;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.5em;width:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);color:initial;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">只要自身在場，雙方場上的<b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BREAK%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"BREAK\"><img alt=\"BREAK\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/6a/TCG_BREAK.png/70px-TCG_BREAK.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/6a/TCG_BREAK.png/105px-TCG_BREAK.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/6a/TCG_BREAK.png/140px-TCG_BREAK.png 2x\" /></a></span>進化</b>寶可夢的特性全部無效（包括之前的特性）。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">只要自身在場，雙方場上的<b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BREAK%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"BREAK\"><img alt=\"BREAK\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/6a/TCG_BREAK.png/70px-TCG_BREAK.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/6a/TCG_BREAK.png/105px-TCG_BREAK.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/6a/TCG_BREAK.png/140px-TCG_BREAK.png 2x\" /></a></span>進化</b>寶可夢的特性全部無效（包括之前的特性）。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">このポケモンがいるかぎり、おたがいの場の<b>BREAK進化</b>ポケモンの特性は、すべてなくなる(引きついだ特性も含む)。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Each Pokémon BREAK has no Abilities (this includes Abilities of its previous Evolutions).</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"width:100px;font-size:1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"無色（TCG）\"><img alt=\"無\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"無色（TCG）\"><img alt=\"無\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:100px;display:none;\" class=\"at-l\"><span class=\"bg-黑2 roundy-20 textwhite\"><b>&#160;&#160;招式&#160;&#160;</b></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.7em;\"><b><span class=\"lang-zh-\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E7%88%AA%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89\" title=\"暗影爪（招式）\">暗影爪</a></span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">暗影爪</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">サシャドークロー</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Shadow Claw</span></b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-r\" style=\"font-size:1.6em;\"><b>110</b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.5em;width:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);color:initial;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">在不看對手手牌的情況下選擇對手的1張手牌並丟棄。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">在不看對手手牌的情況下選擇對手的1張手牌並丟棄。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">相手の手札からオモテを見ないで1枚選び、トラッシュする。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Discard a random card from your opponent's hand.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"95%\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" class=\"textblack\">\n<table style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #E1E1E1; border-top:1px solid #E1E1E1;\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"50%\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%B1%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"弱點（TCG）\">弱點</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8A%B5%E6%8A%97%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"抵抗力（TCG）\">抵抗力</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family:Lucida Console;\">\n<th><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%B6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"惡（TCG）\"><img alt=\"惡\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/20px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/30px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/40px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>×2\n</th>\n<th><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%97%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"鬥（TCG）\"><img alt=\"鬥\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/a/ab/%E6%96%97_TCG.png/20px-%E6%96%97_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/a/ab/%E6%96%97_TCG.png/30px-%E6%96%97_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/a/ab/%E6%96%97_TCG.png/40px-%E6%96%97_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>-20\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"50%\" valign=\"middle\">\n<table class=\"at-l roundybr-25 roundytl-25 b-COLO\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"display:none;\" class=\"bg-钢 va-t\">\n<td class=\"roundytl-25 at-l bg-钢 va-t t-皮卡丘\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;width:5em;\"><span class=\"roundybr-25 roundytl-25 bg-黑2\">&#160;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6EX%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"寶可夢EX（TCG）\">寶可夢<i><b>EX</b></i></a> 規則&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"textblack\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">雖然因為粗暴的性格而遭到放逐，但牠一直在名為毀壞的世界的地方，靜靜地看著原來的世界。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">雖然因為粗暴的性格而遭到放逐，但牠一直在名為毀壞的世界的地方，靜靜地看著原來的世界。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">暴れ者 ゆえ 追い出されたが 破れた世界と 言われる 場所で 静かに 光の世界を 見ていた。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"at-c textblack\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%92%A4%E9%80%80%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"撤退（TCG）\">撤退</a><span style=\"padding: 0px; 10px;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"100%\" class=\"roundybottom a-c at-c\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);color:initial;\">\n<p>語言切換：<span class=\"lang-zh-\"><b>中</b>  | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-ja- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-\">日</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-en- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-\">英</span></sp