olSMXY.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\" rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/wiki/THE_BEST_OF_XY%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"THE BEST OF XY（TCG）\">THE BEST OF XY</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\" rowspan=\"1\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%C2%B7%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%AE%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"太陽‧月亮系列（TCG）\">太陽‧月亮系列</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"\" rowspan=\"1\">2017-04-21\n</td>\n<td class=\"\" rowspan=\"1\">—\n</td>\n<td class=\"\" rowspan=\"1\">048/131\n</td>\n<td class=\"hide\" rowspan=\"0\">\n</td>\n<td>&#8212;\n</td>\n<td class=\"\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/5ban_Graphics\" title=\"5ban Graphics\">5ban Graphics</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"hide\">[[]]\n</td>\n<td class=\"hide\">[[]]\n<p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"17\" class=\"at-l bgl-超C roundybottom\"><small>\n<ul><li>共用同一圖片的版本、同一行內日文和英文版本的卡牌插畫相同，因此除非特殊標誌<span class=\"explain\" title=\"如25週年特典卡與慶典的標誌\">*</span>不同，則不重複列出。但卡面樣式、閃卡樣式、收集編號、擴充標誌會有差異。</li>\n<li>同一版本的不同地區間存在發布時間差異的，以發布時間最早的地區的當地日期為準。</li></ul>\n</small><p><small></small>\n</p>\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E8.8E.B7.E5.BE.97.E6.96.B9.E6.B3.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"获得方法\">獲得方法</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：獲得方法\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 獲得方法\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"284.2FXY-P\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"284/XY-P\">284/XY-P</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：284/XY-P\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 284/XY-P\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>集換式卡牌遊戲道館。\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"XY184\">XY184</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節：XY184\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： XY184\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>購買<b>騎拉帝納三包吸塑包</b>（英文︰<b>Giratina Three Pack Blister</b>）附贈。\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.BB.86.E8.8A.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"细节\">細節</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"編輯章節：細節\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3%EF%BC%88XY-P%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 細節\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>這張卡牌的寶可夢圖鑑來自《<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AF%B6%E5%8F%AF%E5%A4%A2_%EF%BC%B8%EF%BC%8F%EF%BC%B9\" title=\"寶可夢 Ｘ／Ｙ\">Ｙ</a>》。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E7%88%AA%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89\" title=\"暗影爪（招式）\">暗影爪</a>是<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AA%91%E6%8B%89%E5%B8%9D%E7%BA%B3\" title=\"騎拉帝納\">騎拉帝納</a>在<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AF%B6%E5%8F%AF%E5%A4%A2%E9%81%8A%E6%88%B2\" title=\"寶可夢遊戲\">遊戲</a>中可以學會的招式。</li></ul>\n<table class=\"roundy-80 bd-神奇宝贝百科 bgwhite at-c\" style=\"width: 60%; clear: both; margin: 10px auto;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"30px\">\n</td>\n<td width=\"60px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/6/63/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%8C%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B.png/80px-%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%8C%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"73\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/6/63/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%8C%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B.png 1.5x\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td><big>這個頁面屬於<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91:%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%8C%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B\" title=\"神奇寶貝百科:卡牌工程\">神奇寶貝百科卡牌工程</a>，歡迎加入<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A5%9E%E5%A5%87%E5%AE%9D%E8%B4%9D%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91:%E5%8D%A1%E7%89%8C%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B\" title=\"神奇寶貝百科:卡牌工程\">卡牌工程</a>。</big>\n</td>\n<td width=\"60px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/4/4b/Wikilogo.png/80px-Wikilogo.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"73\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/4/4b/Wikilogo.png 1.5x\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30px\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260908073105\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.171 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.273 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3646/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25889/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4001/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip po